### Summary / Symptom
Claim reserve amounts on the adjuster dashboard are displaying in the wrong currency for international claims. USD amounts are being displayed as GBP for claims filed in the UK region. The correct currency is stored in the database but the display layer is showing the wrong symbol. Adjusters can see the correct value by running a manual report.

